# Example documents bundled with the program, shown in the File->Examples menu.
#
#   <resource> [| <display name> [| <real file name>]]
#
# Every resource ends in .dat so that it is bundled on every platform; the real name is the
# resource name with that .dat stripped. All examples are complete SplitsTree6 documents, so
# that they can be loaded from memory without being written to a temporary file.

buttercups-cytochromeC.stree6.dat | Buttercups cytochrome C (Neighbor Net)
dusky-dolphins.stree6.dat         | Dusky dolphins mtDNA (Split Decomposition)
popart-example.stree6.dat         | PopART example (Median Joining)
candida-orthopsilosis.stree6.dat  | Candida orthopsilosis hybrids (Median Joining)
Nymphoides-PhyloFusion.stree6.dat | Nymphoides gene trees (PhyloFusion)
